<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 182 0 R
/E (Not so long ago, there was only The Dealer and the Great Deck. The apparition of the universe, life, love, death and every heartbeat, was shuffled and assigned to the world's spirits and dealt by a wise, expert who knew what was best for the cycle of life.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 182 0 R
/E (Due to an unknown change of events, The Dealer has become bored, cynical and has chosen to change things up. He shuffled the Great Deck and threw its cards like autumn leaves across the mortal plane.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 182 0 R
/E (You are The Fool, the only born soul without an assigned future in a dying and chaotic world where fate has become anarchic. To save what remains, you must dive into the unknown, face The Dealer at his own table and gamble the right to exist.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
