235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 183 0 R
/E (Managing risk is vital, as the player must choose whether to intervene before deciding the target and commiting to the result, using one of their limited options to alter the future. What sustains engagement is the constant negotiation between fate and control. In this balance, the game ensures that every run feels uncertain, but never unfair, just like life. But remember, each decision contributes meaningfully to the players descent.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
